Relevant columns and how they will be used  
• `CoC_Number` : identifies each Continuum‑of‑Care (used to limit rows to New York – those that start with “NY‑”).  
• `CoC_Name` : readable label for the CoC (included in result sets).  
• `Count_Year` : the PIT (point‑in‑time) count year; we will look at 2012 and 2018.  
• `Homeless_Veterans` : the metric whose change we need to calculate (2018 minus 2012).  

Main filter conditions that will be reused  
```sql
WHERE LEFT(CoC_Number, 3) = 'NY-'           -- only New York CoCs
AND   Count_Year IN (2012, 2018)            -- keep the two required years
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------  
Below are ten exploratory → increasingly‑complex queries (each different, each limited to 20 rows) that would ultimately lead to the answer.  
------------------------------------------------------------------------  

```sql
--Description: 1) Peek at raw New York records, any year
SELECT *
FROM `bigquery-public-data.sdoh_hud_pit_homelessness.hud_pit_by_coc`
WHERE LEFT(CoC_Number, 3) = 'NY-'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 2) List all distinct years available for New York CoCs
SELECT DISTINCT Count_Year
FROM `bigquery-public-data.sdoh_hud_pit_homelessness.hud_pit_by_coc`
WHERE LEFT(CoC_Number, 3) = 'NY-'
ORDER BY Count_Year
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 3) Show every New York CoC that has a 2012 record
SELECT DISTINCT CoC_Number, CoC_Name
FROM `bigquery-public-data.sdoh_hud_pit_homelessness.hud_pit_by_coc`
WHERE LEFT(CoC_Number, 3) = 'NY-'
  AND Count_Year = 2012
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 4) Inspect 2012 homeless‑veteran counts for New York
SELECT CoC_Number,
       CoC_Name,
       Homeless_Veterans
FROM `bigquery-public-data.sdoh_hud_pit_homelessness.hud_pit_by_coc`
WHERE LEFT(CoC_Number, 3) = 'NY-'
  AND Count_Year = 2012
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 5) Inspect 2018 homeless‑veteran counts for New York
SELECT CoC_Number,
       CoC_Name,
       Homeless_Veterans
FROM `bigquery-public-data.sdoh_hud_pit_homelessness.hud_pit_by_coc`
WHERE LEFT(CoC_Number, 3) = 'NY-'
  AND Count_Year = 2018
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 6) For each New York CoC, place 2012 and 2018 counts side‑by‑side
SELECT a.CoC_Number,
       a.CoC_Name,
       a.Homeless_Veterans AS vets_2012,
       b.Homeless_Veterans AS vets_2018
FROM `bigquery-public-data.sdoh_hud_pit_homelessness.hud_pit_by_coc` AS a
JOIN `bigquery-public-data.sdoh_hud_pit_homelessness.hud_pit_by_coc` AS b
  ON a.CoC_Number = b.CoC_Number
WHERE a.Count_Year = 2012
  AND b.Count_Year = 2018
  AND LEFT(a.CoC_Number, 3) = 'NY-'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 7) Add the change (2018‑2012) in homeless veterans
SELECT a.CoC_Number,
       a.CoC_Name,
       a.Homeless_Veterans AS vets_2012,
       b.Homeless_Veterans AS vets_2018,
       b.Homeless_Veterans - a.Homeless_Veterans AS change_vets
FROM `bigquery-public-data.sdoh_hud_pit_homelessness.hud_pit_by_coc` AS a
JOIN `bigquery-public-data.sdoh_hud_pit_homelessness.hud_pit_by_coc` AS b
  ON a.CoC_Number = b.CoC_Number
WHERE a.Count_Year = 2012
  AND b.Count_Year = 2018
  AND LEFT(a.CoC_Number, 3) = 'NY-'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 8) Same as #7 but exclude CoCs missing either 2012 or 2018 (INNER JOIN already does that)
SELECT a.CoC_Number,
       a.CoC_Name,
       a.Homeless_Veterans AS vets_2012,
       b.Homeless_Veterans AS vets_2018,
       b.Homeless_Veterans - a.Homeless_Veterans AS change_vets
FROM `bigquery-public-data.sdoh_hud_pit_homelessness.hud_pit_by_coc` a
JOIN `bigquery-public-data.sdoh_hud_pit_homelessness.hud_pit_by_coc` b
  ON a.CoC_Number = b.CoC_Number
WHERE a.Count_Year = 2012
  AND b.Count_Year = 2018
  AND LEFT(a.CoC_Number, 3) = 'NY-'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 9) Order the changes from largest decrease to largest increase
SELECT a.CoC_Number,
       a.CoC_Name,
       a.Homeless_Veterans AS vets_2012,
       b.Homeless_Veterans AS vets_2018,
       b.Homeless_Veterans - a.Homeless_Veterans AS change_vets
FROM `bigquery-public-data.sdoh_hud_pit_homelessness.hud_pit_by_coc` a
JOIN `bigquery-public-data.sdoh_hud_pit_homelessness.hud_pit_by_coc` b
  ON a.CoC_Number = b.CoC_Number
WHERE a.Count_Year = 2012
  AND b.Count_Year = 2018
  AND LEFT(a.CoC_Number, 3) = 'NY-'
ORDER BY change_vets ASC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 10) FINAL ANSWER – change in homeless veterans (2018 minus 2012) for each New York CoC
SELECT a.CoC_Number,
       a.CoC_Name,
       a.Homeless_Veterans  AS Homeless_Veterans_2012,
       b.Homeless_Veterans  AS Homeless_Veterans_2018,
       b.Homeless_Veterans - a.Homeless_Veterans AS Change_2018_vs_2012
FROM `bigquery-public-data.sdoh_hud_pit_homelessness.hud_pit_by_coc` AS a
JOIN `bigquery-public-data.sdoh_hud_pit_homelessness.hud_pit_by_coc` AS b
  ON a.CoC_Number = b.CoC_Number
WHERE a.Count_Year = 2012
  AND b.Count_Year = 2018
  AND LEFT(a.CoC_Number, 3) = 'NY-'
ORDER BY CoC_Number
LIMIT 20;
```
